{
  "name": "Kerbooth 360° — Acompte payé (Stripe) → réservation confirmée",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "kerbooth-stripe-acompte-paid",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1c1c1c1-0002-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Stripe (acompte réglé)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "kerbooth-stripe-acompte-paid",
      "notes": "À connecter à l'événement Stripe checkout.session.completed (ou payment_intent.succeeded selon l'intégration retenue). Le bookingId doit être passé en métadonnée Stripe à la création de la session de paiement (voir workflow kerbooth-yousign-contract-signed) pour être retrouvé ici. Signature AVANT paiement (revu le 20/09/2026) : ce webhook confirme directement la réservation, plus besoin d'envoyer le contrat à ce stade."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.APP_URL }}/api/kerbooth/bookings/{{ $json.body.data.object.metadata.bookingId }}/acompte-paid",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.INGEST_API_TOKEN }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ stripeCustomerId: $json.body.data.object.customer, paidAt: new Date($json.body.data.object.created * 1000).toISOString() }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1c1c1c1-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Marquer l'acompte payé (facture + confirmation)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Stripe (acompte réglé)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Marquer l'acompte payé (facture + confirmation)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "id": "d1d1d1d1-0002-4000-8000-000000000001"
}
